  "boundary": "The Vault is Harbor's ledger of debt and internal credit. It holds debt, an amount of HRD up to 4. It holds free, an amount of HRD up to 4. It holds issued, an amount of HRD up to 4. It holds ceiling, a count from 2 to 4, starting at 2. It receives borrow and repay from the User, move and release from the Adapter, and change from the Timelock. It never knows who holds the HRD the Adapter mints.",
